# error: 31:5: `by_box` stores a view of `s` in `self`
# error: 34:11: `by_defer` stores a view of `s` in `self`
# error: 39:7: `by_value` stores a view of `s` in `self`
# error: 43:7: `by_payload` stores a view of `s` in `self`
# error: 48:9: `by_loop` stores a view of `s` in `self`
# error: 54:3: `link` stores a view of `b` in `a`, which its caller reaches, but its signature does not keep `b`; say so: `keeps b`
# error: 60:5: `register` stores a view of `self` in `out`, which its caller reaches, but its signature does not keep `self`; say so: `keeps self`
